======== 6. N uncorrelated particles in volume V: square of the SUM, both prescriptions ========
[diag_P1] <S_a.S_a> = 3/4
[diag_P2] |<S_a>|^2 = 1/4
[cross] <S_a>.<S_b> = sin(theta)*sin(theta2)*cos(phi - phi2)/4 + cos(theta)*cos(theta2)/4 -> averaged over both orientations = 0
[N=2_explicit] <S_tot.S_tot> = exp(-I*phi_1 + I*phi_2)*sin(theta_1)*sin(theta_2)/4 + exp(I*phi_1 - I*phi_2)*sin(theta_1)*sin(theta_2)/4 + cos(theta_1)*cos(theta_2)/2 + 3/2
