[N=3_avg] orientation average = 9/4  (= 3 * 3/4: True)
[unpol_P1] <(sum_a S_a)^2> = 3*N/4
[unpol_P2] <(sum_a <S_a>)^2> = N/4
[square_of_mean] |<sum_a S_a>|^2 = 0
[density_P1] <s^2> for the density s = (1/V) sum_a S_a:  3*N/(4*V**2)  = (3/4) n/V with n=N/V -> True
[scaling_P1] {'leading_power': 1, 'coeff_N2': 0, 'coeff_N1': 3/4}
[scaling_P2] {'leading_power': 1, 'coeff_N2': 0, 'coeff_N1': 1/4}
[convention_coherent_P1] (N * sqrt<S_a.S_a>)^2 = 3*N**2/4   <- coherent sum of per-particle RMS magnitude sqrt(3/4)
[convention_coherent_P2] (N * |<S_a>|)^2      = N**2/4   <- coherent sum of per-particle expectation magnitude 1/2 (= polarized closure)
